# Only the Ghidra project itself is ignored. The recovered decompilation under build/decomp/ is
# TRACKED, deliberately and in line with oot3d-decomp, which tracks its 1374 recovered .c files:
# the whole point of this repository is the readable C, and a .gitignore of `build/` here would
# have silently discarded every function recovered from the image, with no way to tell from a
# clean status that anything had been lost.
build/ghidra/
